The 87 Minnesota counties for the Minnesota QSO Party (rules dated June 8, 2026, for 2027 on)
Outside Minnesota each county is its own multiplier (FCONTEST sets MultipliersIsCounties)
For a Minnesota entrant every county counts as Mn: "In state county multipliers no longer count for MN stations"
No INCLUDE here: an out-of-state entrant's table must hold only counties
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry

